WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:06.650
It may be a faint dream, but let me see it
Hakanaki yume saredo yume misete

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:16.190
I'm in a complete daze under the sun
Konmei ryouran ni under the sun wow wow

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:20.920
Guided only by my flowering love for you
Konmei ryouran ni do ai do wow wow

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.530
Let the flower of life bloom
Hirakeyo inochi no hana

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:26.390
Let it follow its red hot desires
Akaku atsuku midasarete

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:28.550
This flame runs through the pulses
Fujouri na mirai no kodou

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:31.350
Of the absurd future
Kakenukeru honoo

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:36.450
I feel so guilty for devoting myself to earning your love
Aisaretakute kono mi sasageru tsumibukasa ga

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:40.530
I feel it tingling inside me
Watashi no naka de jirijiri shiteru ne

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:42.030
Desire
Yokubou

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:45.740
A bolt of lightning that brings about tomorrow
Sore wa ashita wo maneku inazuma

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:50.660
And turns into great pleasure
Yagate tsuyoi yorokobi ni naru

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:56.510
I'm sure you don't know yet
Mada shiranai hazu anata wa kitto

00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:03.250
It's cruel when you can't even have a faint dream
Hakanaki yume saredo yume minu hibi wa mugoi yo

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:08.220
I want to hold on to these newborn desires
Umaretate no negai wo tada dakishimete itai

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:11.510
More wild than soft
Yasashii yori mo hageshiku ne

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:14.710
That will make my day
Sore de ima ga michite kuru sa

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:21.230
Who is going to protect this world (this dangerous world)
Michibikarete tashikameru sekai wa (ayaui sekai wa)

00:01:21.230 --> 00:01:23.150
That I can only see for myself?
Dare ga mamoru

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:29.670
I can do it, so love me truly
Mamoreru dakara honki de ai shiteyo

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:34.510
<b>Sasaki Kojirou</b>

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:36.680
<b>Jealousy</b>

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:38.950
Musashi...

00:01:50.230 --> 00:01:53.110
Maid Cafe True Shadow

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:56.050
Another profitable day.

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:57.810
Business is booming!

00:01:57.810 --> 00:02:00.100
It's great that we're getting more customers,

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:04.570
but did you hear that maid cafés are popping up around the station?

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:07.210
Yes, I'm aware of that.

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:12.580
And so, in a move to steal their customers, we're getting another maid!

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:20.000
If that's the case, then please employ me, Gisen.

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:25.310
<b>Gisen</b>

00:02:26.770 --> 00:02:27.970
<b>Return</b>

00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:27.980
You're still alive, Gisen?
<b>Return</b>

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:29.520
You're still alive, Gisen?

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:32.390
Juubei also came back alive,

00:02:32.390 --> 00:02:35.070
so it's no surprise that she survived.

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:38.530
You came to give yourself up without a fight?

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:40.200
What are you scheming this time?

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:42.060
I was just bored.

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:43.200
Bored?

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:49.860
You must be aware that Shirou-sama won't be revived for at least a hundred years.

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:53.520
As if those four weren't enough of a headache...

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:55.100
Why did you have to show up too?

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:56.870
I've heard of them as well.

00:02:56.870 --> 00:03:00.250
I brought some information that might help you.

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:01.550
Information?

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:02.790
It's just gonna be lies.

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:05.490
You're free to choose whether or not to believe it.

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:10.050
I just don't want to let anyone else have Muneakira-sama and Onee-sama.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:11.630
Gittan...

00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:15.980
Do you know what Samurai Brides are?

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:17.570
<b>Samurai Bride</b>

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:22.790
Samurai who have pledged themselves to a General are Master Samurai,

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:28.350
but sometimes, although extremely rare, one gains an even greater power.

00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:32.530
That one is the Samurai Bride, the Queen of Blades,

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:35.240
the General's one and only bride.

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:37.790
I've never heard about that.

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:41.000
I can't deny the possibility that it might be true.

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:45.090
When I investigated Master Samurai before,

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:49.060
there were records implying that some had exceptional powers.

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:50.920
Tell us!

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:54.370
What are the conditions for becoming the Samurai Bride?

00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:56.130
Sadly, I don't know that much.

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:58.110
Was that information supposed to be useful?

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:01.090
I'm worried for Onee-sama's safety.

00:04:01.730 --> 00:04:04.980
Onee-sama, please allow me to join you.

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:10.380
You mustn't do anything bad until Shirou returns, okay?

00:04:10.990 --> 00:04:11.660
Of course!

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:13.990
She still shouldn't if he did.

00:04:13.990 --> 00:04:14.910
Indeed.

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:18.540
Gisen, I want to trust you,

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:21.010
but I can't forget that you used that eye of yours to control me,

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:24.530
to hurt those dear to me, and to threaten the peace of the Empire.

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:27.600
That's not something I can just ignore.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:29.540
Wise words.

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:32.010
In that case, I should leave.

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:34.680
Everyone, fare thee well.

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:38.880
She undid Hanzou's bondage knots just like that?

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:39.430
Impossible!

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:40.070
We can't allow someone so dangerous to wander around freely.

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:42.390
<b>Welcome!
We can't allow someone so dangerous to wander around freely.</b>

00:04:42.390 --> 00:04:42.400
<b>Welcome!</b>

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:43.520
Catch her!

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:52.610
Does this mean that I can stay?

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:54.050
For now.

00:04:54.050 --> 00:04:55.700
Hurray!

00:04:57.150 --> 00:04:59.660
I'm sorry, but you'll be staying here tonight.

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:02.370
What if I need to use the privy?

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:04.660
I'll go with you!

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:07.000
I'll be here all night long!

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:10.840
Then when the time comes, I will ask you to do that, Onee-sama.

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:12.350
<b>Dark Samurai</b>

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:15.060
Don't you think you're taking your games too far?

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:17.800
What's wrong? You jealous?

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:19.550
That's absurd.

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:23.510
I'm just worried you might have forgotten our purpose, Musashi-han.

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:25.320
Just be honest. Jeez!

00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:27.810
You just don't wanna see her
near that girl, right?

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:30.820
It's so entertaining when lovers fight!

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:34.500
Wanna fight me? I'm in.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.270
Pointless.

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:38.160
You know that neither of you could win.

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:40.280
Oh, whatever.

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:42.290
I'll tone it down.

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:47.040
Onee-sama! Onee-sama!

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:49.350
What's wrong, Gittan?
Need to go potty?

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:52.590
There is something I'd like to discuss with Yukimura-sama in private.

00:05:52.590 --> 00:05:53.920
Would you call her for me?

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:56.060
Okey-dokey!

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:57.560
<b>Inspection 1</b>

00:05:57.970 --> 00:06:00.010
What do you want from me so late at night?

00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:04.720
Actually, I have a vague notion of the conditions for becoming the Samurai Bride.

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:07.770
What?! The conditions for becoming the Samurai Bride?

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:09.320
I knew you were hiding something.

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:11.290
If I may speak frankly,

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:16.170
I believe that someone as resourceful as yourself, Yukimura-san,

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:17.400
is suited to become the Samurai Bride.

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:18.110
Me?

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:19.110
Conditions?
Me?

00:06:19.110 --> 00:06:24.030
However, the conditions - forgive my
bluntness - put you at a disadvantage.

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:28.790
You may be able to fulfill them sometime in the future, but not at present.

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:29.850
Stop beating around the bush!

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:31.170
What are the conditions?

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:33.540
A certain body.

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:39.220
And by that, I mean the body of an adult, preferably a well-endowed one.

00:06:40.220 --> 00:06:41.490
What?!

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:44.680
What do you think of her statement?

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:48.390
I don't think we should take it at face value.

00:06:48.390 --> 00:06:49.310
However...

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:52.810
If there's a possibility, however slight,

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:55.860
it's the way of the Sanada to prepare for that!

00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:58.190
Milk! Get me milk!

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:06.690
Just watch. I'll acquire a beautiful body for sure!

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:08.710
Onee-sama. Onee-sama!

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:10.330
Onee-sama!

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:14.420
Onee-sama, would you call Princess Sen for me?

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:16.140
Okay, Gittan!

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:17.640
<b>Inspection 2</b>

00:07:18.190 --> 00:07:19.850
If I may speak frankly,

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:22.230
I believe that someone as noble as you, Princess Sen,

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:26.390
is suited to become Muneakira-sama's Samurai Bride.

00:07:26.390 --> 00:07:29.390
So what are the conditions for that?

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:33.270
Please forgive my rudeness, but I am afraid it may be out of your reach.

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:37.150
The problem stems from your upbringing, so there's not much you can do.

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:39.040
Stop beating around the bush! Just spit it out!

00:07:39.570 --> 00:07:41.540
A good mind.

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:46.580
And by that, I mean a mind of utmost fortitude that does not falter in the face of any danger.

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:48.870
A-A good mind?

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:51.220
Give me a break.

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:54.170
The condition to be the Samurai Bride is a good mind?

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:56.000
It's blatantly obvious she's lying.

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:59.510
And how could I improve my mental fortitude?

00:07:59.510 --> 00:08:02.600
Hanzou, do you have any ideas?

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:05.780
I do. Please leave it to me, milady.

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:14.100
H-Hey! Will this really improve my mental fortitude?

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:18.330
Personally, I considered this the best possible option.

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:20.190
I sure hope you're right!

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:23.690
You're a total masochist!
I shouldn't have listened to you!

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:26.150
Onee-sama! Onee-sama!

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:27.420
Onee-sama!

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:29.520
What is it, Gittan?

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:32.080
Call Kanetsugu-san for me this time.

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:33.720
Okey-dokey!

00:08:34.010 --> 00:08:35.220
<b>Inspection 3</b>

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:37.340
If I may speak frankly,

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:39.750
I believe that someone who knows true love, as you do,

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:44.050
is best suited to become Muneakira-sama's Samurai Bride.

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:46.210
You're quite right about that.

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:49.900
So what's the condition to become his Samurai Bride?

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:52.140
There could be nothing simpler.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:56.150
A contract greater than a kiss must be formed with Muneakira-sama.

00:08:56.150 --> 00:08:59.650
G-Greater than a kiss?!

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:06.570
A-A contract greater than a kiss would mean...

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:08.410
that...

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:11.690
Listen, Kanetsugu.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:13.910
This time, I'll pour my love into you.

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:23.840
Now then, which of them could be the correct answer?

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:27.270
Or is the key in the General's hands?

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:29.850
Hey, Gittan.

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:33.550
I wonder if I could become his Samurai Bride?

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:34.560
Onee-sama...

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:37.940
I want to protect Onii-chan too,

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:41.580
but I can't transform into a Master Samurai anymore.

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:44.110
I'm certain that is only temporary.

00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:46.390
You need not worry about it.

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:47.170
But still...

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:52.550
If you're that uncertain, swing your sword ten thousand times every day as practice.

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:54.580
Then your powers are sure to return.

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:57.210
And you could become his Samurai Bride too.

00:09:57.210 --> 00:09:58.080
Really?

00:09:58.080 --> 00:09:59.080
Yes!

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:01.170
Then I'll go and start right now!

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:04.510
Oh!

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:07.410
Gittan! Need a potty break?

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:09.100
No need to worry.

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:10.860
I'll be right back!

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:13.950
Maybe I should've said a hundred thousand.

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:20.480
Either way, regaining one's lost powers is not so simple.

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:24.480
<b>The next day</b>

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:25.480
Maid Cafe True Shadow

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:27.000
<b>True Shadow</b>

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:27.950
Closed

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:29.910
Huh? Why is everyone so late?

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:33.910
Indeed. Yukimura-sama went to bed late last night.

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:35.140
I see.

00:10:35.140 --> 00:10:37.580
Did Princess Sen do the same?

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:41.430
I really took things quite far last night.

00:10:41.430 --> 00:10:48.840
I can expect her to return it twofold... or even tenfold!

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:52.770
Hanzou-san is acting strangely as well.

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:54.860
Pardon my lateness!

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:58.140
Yukimura, what on earth...

00:10:58.140 --> 00:11:00.330
I'm still growing, you see.

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:02.610
Sometimes that growth even happens overnight.

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:05.850
You look sexy indeed, Yukimura-sama.

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:07.620
Good morning to you, my dear lord and ladies.

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:12.070
I pray this bright day may bring great fortune to each of you.

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:14.990
You're so graceful, milady!

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:17.810
What's gotten into you, Princess Sen?

00:11:17.810 --> 00:11:19.370
What are you scheming?

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:20.850
What could you possibly mean?

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:23.450
I am as I've always been.

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:25.790
Here I am, everyone!

00:11:25.790 --> 00:11:30.680
Last night was so hot and humid that I could hardly sleep.

00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:31.340
Even you?!

00:11:32.930 --> 00:11:36.150
Good morning, you beast of a man, Muneakira.

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:37.480
Oh? How silly I am!

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:40.270
In this heat, I forgot my uniform.

00:11:40.270 --> 00:11:43.310
I'm just feeling so <i>hot</i> today.

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:47.380
I am quite confident in my mental fortitude, Muneakira.

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:50.710
Go ahead, take my nice body!

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:55.320
You're such a beast. Pounce on me already.

00:11:55.320 --> 00:11:57.140
Look at my great body!

00:11:57.140 --> 00:11:59.950
Don't you think I'd make the best Samurai Bride?

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:04.300
No, you should acknowledge my grace and take me as your Samurai Bride.

00:12:04.300 --> 00:12:07.210
Wh-What's going on here?!

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:12.710
You're a General! Pledge yourself already, Muneakira!

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:16.810
What nonsense are you going on about?

00:12:16.810 --> 00:12:19.050
Nonsense?! I don't wanna hear that from you!

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:20.470
Yeah, ya dumb bitch!

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:21.730
What did you say?!

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:21.740
Anyway, why are you wearing that?
It doesn't suit you at all.
What did you say?!

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:25.830
Anyway, why are you wearing that?
It doesn't suit you at all.

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:27.980
And what's with that unbalanced body?

00:12:27.980 --> 00:12:31.150
That calls for... this!

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:33.200
And this!

00:12:33.740 --> 00:12:37.630
You can't develop mental fortitude overnight.

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:38.800
Nor breasts.

00:12:40.370 --> 00:12:41.870
What's going on today?!

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:51.380
And the place was just getting on the right track.

00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:53.600
<b>An hour later</b>

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:54.720
We'll be closed today.

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:56.220
<b>Closed temporarily</b>

00:12:56.220 --> 00:12:56.790
We'll be closed today.

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:58.850
We are terribly sorry.
We'll be closed today.

00:12:58.850 --> 00:12:58.860
We are terribly sorry.

00:12:58.860 --> 00:12:59.900
Seriously?

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:01.480
They made us queue for so long, and this is what we get?

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:02.850
I'm never coming again.

00:13:03.330 --> 00:13:05.860
We are terribly sorry.

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:08.270
Hey! I'm here to see the Fake.

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:13.530
I'm terribly sorry, but we are closed today.

00:13:13.530 --> 00:13:16.010
Huh? So I can't see the Fake?

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:18.280
That's right. I'm afraid Juubei had some urgent business.

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:21.380
But she promised just yesterday!

00:13:21.840 --> 00:13:25.620
Destroying that girl really is my only choice.

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:27.630
Okay.

00:13:27.630 --> 00:13:31.030
Tell the Fake I'll come back tomorrow.

00:13:31.030 --> 00:13:32.760
Of course. We will be waiting for you.

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:37.970
Why are we bowing to the one who crushed our dojo?

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:40.260
Because she's our most regular customer.

00:13:40.260 --> 00:13:42.600
What are they even thinking?

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:45.910
We haven't decided how to deal with Gisen yet, either.

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:49.310
Huh? Where's Juubei?

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:51.020
Gisen!

00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:54.650
Gisen? What happened? Are you all right?

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:59.540
Gisen? Did something happen?
Are you all right?

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:01.580
Yes, there's nothing wrong with me.

